Subject: [PATCH 32/49] bcrypt: Implement the SP800-108 CTR HMAC key derivation
 function.

Used by the ASP.NET Core data protection stack.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016s12iuoTmYVZJQsft4SbDV
---
